{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026giuAD65kEy1793230412.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>以色列國會選舉結束，初步點票指，總理內塔尼亞胡陣營領先。</p><p></p><p>選委會在周三點算九成選票，指領導利庫德集團的內塔尼亞胡，其右翼陣營贏得53席。以軍前總參謀長埃森科特領導的反對派陣營贏得48席。若以個別政黨計算，利庫德集團有26席，成為國會最大黨。</p><p></p><p>由於沒有任何陣營得票達到半數門檻的61票，意味政黨要籌組成立聯合政府。外界關注不滿現屆政府贏得19席的阿拉伯裔政黨會否支持埃森科特，變相讓內塔尼亞胡無法連任總理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T00:20:53.919543+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T23:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T01:58:11.499743+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T00:18:13.180834+00:00","content_hash":"a1a84c814ba9ad61533f2194c9ffb8be22a455cfdf8b484552ce3fb0f395ad06","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T00:20:53.919543+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}